translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_9e6fc692:

    # FAWHA "{i}*Gasp!*{/i}"
    FAWHA "{i}*헉!*{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:9
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_58827ada:

    # FAWHA @ smile "It's you!"
    FAWHA @ smile "당신이군요!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:10
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_b355d1c4:

    # MC @ talk "Fawha?"
    MC @ talk "파와?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:11
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_0b81376e:

    # MC @ talk "What's happened here?"
    MC @ talk "여기 무슨 일이 있었어?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:15
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_567f7c0b:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Why hello sir, you may call me Fawha."
    FAWHA @ talk "아 안녕하세요 손님, 파와라고 불러주세요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:18
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_aee11678:

    # FAWHA @ talk "What pleasure do you seek tonight, sir?"
    FAWHA @ talk "오늘 밤 어떤 즐거움을 찾으시나요, 손님?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:19
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_f0104eae:

    # MC @ talk "This place has changed since I was last here..."
    MC @ talk "마지막으로 왔을 때보다 이곳이 변했군..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:20
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_20c5e206:

    # FAWHA @ talk "A-Ah... Yes, a lot has no doubt changed these past few days."
    FAWHA @ talk "아-아... 네, 지난 며칠 사이에 많은 게 변한 게 틀림없어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:21
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_8eb2c968:

    # MC @ talk "Can you talk about it?"
    MC @ talk "그 얘기를 해줄 수 있어?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:22
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_e9dd749a:

    # FAWHA @ talk "It's not exactly much of a secret anymore what's been going on sir..."
    FAWHA @ talk "무슨 일이 있었는지는 더 이상 그다지 비밀이 아니에요, 손님..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:25
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_da9e306b:

    # FAWHA @ talk "After Tarek was killed, the rival factions have been tearing each other apart to grab what they can of Tarek's old territory."
    FAWHA @ talk "타레크가 살해된 후, 경쟁 파벌들이 타레크의 옛 영역에서 챙길 수 있는 걸 움켜쥐기 위해 서로 찢어발기고 있어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:26
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_7a940b86:

    # FAWHA @ talk "The Khazhah have managed to push out the rival factions and take over management here."
    FAWHA @ talk "카자파가 경쟁 파벌들을 몰아내고 이곳의 운영권을 장악했어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:27
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_ca4ecab6:

    # MC @ talk "Are you treated well?"
    MC @ talk "잘 대우받고 있어?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:28
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_a26c51b6:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Khazah's treat us well enough I suppose, but they're flooding the place with more raza than the Vulshan's ever did."
    FAWHA @ talk "카자가 우리를 충분히 잘 대우하는 것 같아요, 하지만 그들은 불샨이 했던 것보다 훨씬 더 많은 약을 이곳에 풀고 있어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:29
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_d37638f8:

    # FAWHA @ sad "Things are becoming more violent than ever now... I fear things will only get worse before they get better."
    FAWHA @ sad "지금 상황이 그 어느 때보다 폭력적으로 되어가고 있어요... 나아지기 전에 더 나빠질까 봐 두려워요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:32
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_f237078f:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Since Tarek's death, the Vulshan have re-organised themselves and begun aggressively pushing back against Khazahs."
    FAWHA @ talk "타레크의 죽음 이후, 불샨은 재정비를 마치고 공격적으로 카자를 밀어내기 시작했어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:33
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_d1725403:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Without Tarek holding everyone together, the usual in-fighting has returned."
    FAWHA @ talk "타레크가 모두를 하나로 묶어주지 않으니, 평소의 내분이 돌아왔어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:34
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_dc35f411:

    # FAWHA @ talk "More and more factions are choosing sides, and I don't think it will be long before things become all out war."
    FAWHA @ talk "점점 더 많은 파벌들이 편을 가르고 있어요, 상황이 전면전이 되기까지 오래 걸리지 않을 것 같아요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:35
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_228713d7:

    # MC "(Hmm, I should maybe keep one eye on this situation.)"
    MC "(흠, 이 상황을 한쪽 눈으로 지켜봐야 할지도 모르겠군.)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:36
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_a4cfcd1e:

    # MC @ talk "How are the Vulshan treating you without Tarek?"
    MC @ talk "타레크 없이 불샨은 널 어떻게 대하고 있어?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:37
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_d0a7eb58:

    # FAWHA @ smile "Better than ever actually."
    FAWHA @ smile "사실 그 어느 때보다 더 잘해주고 있어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:38
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_4f5bf1f7:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Thanks to you and your friend, they've told us we are 'marked' girls."
    FAWHA @ talk "당신과 당신 친구 덕분에, 그들이 우리는 '낙인 찍힌' 여자들이라고 말했어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:39
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_68ba2e87:

    # FAWHA @ talk "We've been told to offer our services to you both for free."
    FAWHA @ talk "우리는 두 분께 무료로 서비스를 제공하라고 들었어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:40
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_729736f0:

    # MC @ smile "Really?"
    MC @ smile "정말?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:41
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_ba19b5e9:

    # FAWHA @ talk "You have found a friend in the Vulshan, they also wanted me to let you know they have prepared a private room for you to stay in... Should you wish."
    FAWHA @ talk "당신은 불샨에게서 친구를 얻었어요, 그들은 또한 당신이 머물 수 있는 개인실을 준비해 두었다고 알리라고 했어요... 원하신다면요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:42
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_c9cc4525:

    # MC "(A private room? This could prove useful if I ever need to stay low.)"
    MC "(개인실? 몸을 숨겨야 할 때 유용할 수 있겠군.)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:43
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_93c20070:

    # MC "(But, do I really trust my safety in the hands of people like the Vulshan?)"
    MC "(하지만, 불샨 같은 사람들의 손에 정말 내 안전을 맡길 수 있을까?)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:48
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_bef2be97:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Things have been tense, but we're not at the point of all-out-war yet."
    FAWHA @ talk "상황이 긴장되어 왔지만, 아직 전면전 단계는 아니에요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:49
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_649b6b5d:

    # FAWHA @ talk "Before he left, Tarek summoned a meeting of the leading gangs and announced he would be leaving."
    FAWHA @ talk "떠나기 전에, 타레크는 주요 갱단 회의를 소집하고 자신이 떠날 것이라고 발표했어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:50
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_43b98ff8:

    # FAWHA @ talk "He outlined how the territory under him was to be managed or divided, leaving this place to the Vulshan."
    FAWHA @ talk "그는 자신의 영역이 어떻게 관리되거나 분할될지, 이곳을 불샨에게 맡기며 개괄했어요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:51
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_2f08c5df:

    # FAWHA @ talk "It's the best outcome perhaps, but... The tension is still boiling beneath the surface, and I feel like it has only bought time before the inevitable."
    FAWHA @ talk "아마도 최선의 결과겠지만... 긴장은 여전히 수면 아래서 끓고 있어요, 피할 수 없는 일이 오기 전에 시간만 벌어준 느낌이에요."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn/scr_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn.rpy:53
translate kr ev_blackDiamondFawhaOnReturn_297d3ff3:

    # FAWHA @ talk "I'll be around here for a while if you need anything, just ask."
    FAWHA @ talk "뭐 필요하신 거 있으면 한동안 이 근처에 있을 테니, 그냥 물어보세요."

